        "created_at": "2015-02-21T01:34:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I feel like I saw the answer to this somewhere, but I looked through the rules and FAQ and couldn't find it. &nbsp;What is the standard order of operations for choosing starting hex, rolling starting movement, and choosing starting powers?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:52.683Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
