        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So I feel like I saw the answer to this somewhere, but I looked through the rules and FAQ and couldn&#39;t find it. &nbsp;What is the standard order of operations for choosing starting hex, rolling starting movement, and choosing starting powers?</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
        "moderator": false,
        "admin": false,
        "staff": false,
        "user_id": 11144,
        "hidden": false,
        "trust_level": 1,
        "deleted_at": null,
        "user_deleted": false,
        "edit_reason": null,
        "can_view_edit_history": true,
        "wiki": false,
        "can_accept_answer": false,
        "can_unaccept_answer": false,
        "accepted_answer": false,
        "topic_accepted_answer": false
      },
      {
        "id": 132838,
        "name": "Donner",
        "username": "Donner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-21T01:40:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When we demo it we have a coin toss to see who places first and the other goes first.&nbsp; If you go first, you place second.&nbsp;</p><p>For the tournament the starting locations are set up already and you do a coin flip for place first or go first, where place first gets first ban (I think).</p><p>For starting powers you get to choose two of them and put them into play.&nbsp; During \"Power Up\" you can swap out one of your power cards in play for one in hand or if you aren't at your max you can put a power card into play.&nbsp; (Main reasons for not being at max are:&nbsp; Playing AZ, Playing Omnitron-V, or you were incapacitated recently).</p><p>At the start of the game, after you place, you roll your movement.&nbsp; Then, during the \"To Be Continued\" phase you re-roll your movement.&nbsp; If you are incapped, you re-roll your movement when your turn begins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:08:23.614Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 12361,
        "topic_slug": "start-of-game-order-of-operations",
