        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": true,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>When we demo it we have a coin toss to see who places first and the other goes first.&nbsp; If you go first, you place second.&nbsp;</p><p>For the tournament the starting locations are set up already and you do a coin flip for place first or go first, where place first gets first ban (I think).</p><p>For starting powers you get to choose two of them and put them into play.&nbsp; During &quot;Power Up&quot; you can swap out one of your power cards in play for one in hand or if you aren&#39;t at your max you can put a power card into play.&nbsp; (Main reasons for not being at max are:&nbsp; Playing AZ, Playing Omnitron-V, or you were incapacitated recently).</p><p>At the start of the game, after you place, you roll your movement.&nbsp; Then, during the &quot;To Be Continued&quot; phase you re-roll your movement.&nbsp; If you are incapped, you re-roll your movement when your turn begins.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
